    "steps": [
      "Warm the corn tortillas in a dry pan over low heat, about 2 minutes per side, then wrap them in a clean towel to keep warm.",
      "Warm the olive oil in a second skillet on medium at the same time. Add the onion, sprinkle with salt and soften it for 1–2 minutes.",
      "Add the tomato and jalapeño and stir for 1 minute.",
      "Pour in the eggs and keep folding for about 2 minutes, until the vegetables are mixed through and the egg is fully set.",
      "Turn off the heat and season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
      "Divide the eggs evenly among the tortillas. Top with the cotija cheese, cilantro or parsley and hot sauce, if you like.",
      "You nailed it! Grab a plate and dig in."
